ok><name>ARAMAKI TAKASHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SHIRASAKI YOSHIMASA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ARAMAKI, TAKASHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SHIRASAKI, YOSHIMASA</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>An NET-ID allocating method in which when a new communication network is built, the NET-IDs of base stations near the new communication network are checked, and then an appropriate NET-ID is determined according to the result of the check. The NET-ID table stored in the base station is updated with the determined NET-ID.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un procédé d'allocation d'identificateurs de réseau (NET-ID) selon lequel on vérifie les identificateurs NET-ID de stations de base situées à proximité de ce nouveau réseau de communication lorsque l'on établit un nouveau réseau de communication, avant de définir un nouvel identificateur NET-ID en fonction du résultat de cette vérification. Enfin, on met à jour le tableau des identificateurs NET-ID mémorisé dans cette station de base à l'aide de l'identificateur NET-ID défini.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>